# Project Development Phase

## Project Name
Skill-wallet

## Development Process

The project is developed by implementing the frontend, backend and database components.

## Frontend

The frontend provides the user interface and allows users to interact with the system.

## Backend

The backend handles application logic, user requests and communication with the database.

## Database

The database stores user information and skill-related data.

## Major Features

- User Registration
- User Login
- User Profile
- Add Skill
- View Skill
- Update Skill
- Delete Skill
- Skill Tracking

## Development Objective

To convert the proposed system design into a working application.
